2 CONC zabeth HAEGAR b: 1687 Has Children Agnes HAEGAR b: 26 Oct 1697 in Siegen, , Ger. Has Children Anna Catherine HAEGAR b: 15 May 1702 in Siegen, , Ger. http://worldconnect.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=jbh&id=I2037
