1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anna Katharina (Haeger) Hofmann''' was born on May 15, 1702 in Siegen, Arnsberg, NRW, Germany and was baptized on May 15, 1702 in Siegen, Siegen, Westphalia, Prussia, Germany. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-4509
2 CONC 0812 Rev. Johann Heinrich Haeger] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-46230047 Anna Catharina Haeger]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married [https://www.geni.com/profile-64732647 Johann Hoffman] on November 7, 1721.
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-67235624 Agnes Hofmann]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743092018 Anna Catharine Spilman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46258758 John Hoffman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743092026 Unnamed Son Hoffman, stillborn]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 9, 1729 in Culpeper, Culpeper County, Virginia, United States from Died after delivering her stillborn son and was buried in 1729 in Culpeper, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
