1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Johannes Philip Hager''' was born January 18, 1730 in Hesse-Cassel, Germany. He emigrated as a child with his parents to America, arriving in Pennsylvania c.1732, and then settling in New Jersey. He adopted the 
2 CONC English name Phillip. He married Sarah (unk) before 1760 and raised a large family. At some point the family moved to first Augusta County ant then to Tazewell Conty, Virginia.  He died in Tazewell County in 1807.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Philip Hager and wife Sarah:
2 CONT * Jacob Hager, 1760-1850, married Sarah French
2 CONT * Phillip Hager, Jr. 1765-1843, married (1) Mary Garrett and (2) Catherine (unk)
2 CONT * Isaac Hager, born 1774 in Virginia
2 CONT * Michael Hager, 1775-1844, settled in Ross County, Ohio
2 CONT * Barthena Dial Hager, 1775-before 1880, died Lincoln Co. West Virginia
2 CONT * Andrew Hager, born 1784 in Virginia
2 CONT * Catherine Hager, born 1788 in Virginia - one source says Buck Co., PA, but this is unlikely
2 CONT * Abraham Hager, born 1795 in Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Links to additional material
2 CONT *http://genforum.genealogy.com/hager/messages/962.html
2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=32910032-13-2745&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-a18bbcb101ab69c2443f8b6e688e9bfb&mrid=7f0d06e8eb6dc1d1e16ce5ea3d14d971 MyHe
2 CONC ritage Family Trees] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 3 2015, 23:44:37 UTC''
