2 CONT
2 CONT # Burial: AFT 11 MAR 1773 Rectortown, Fauquier Co., VA
2 CONT
2 CONT # Event: Chr (infant) 1 DEC 1711 Trupbach, Siegen, Nordheim-Westfalen, GER
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Hans Jacob RICHTER b: BEF 10 OCT 1674 in Trupbach, Siegen, Nordheim-Westfalen, GER
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Anna 'Elizabetha' FISCHBACH b: 15 APR 1685 in Trupbach, Siegen, Nordheim-Westfalen, GER
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Anna Catherina FISHBACK b: 1714 in , Essex Co., VA (became Spotsylvania-1721, then Orange-1734, then Culpeper-1749, then Madison-1793) Married: 11 MAR 1730 in , Spotsylvania Co., VA (became: Orange Co.-1734; Culpeper Co
2 CONC .-1749; Madison Co., VA-1793) Note: John and Anna Catherina were 1st cousins.
