1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Benjamin Rector''' was born on February 24, 1743 in Germantown, Fauquier County, Virginia.  Son of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Rector/3191184?through=6000000000250017039 and https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Rector/60000000
2 CONC 00249967009?through=6000000000250017039
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin married [https://www.geni.com/profile-45090686 Sarah Rector (Kerr)] on May 9, 1769 in Rectortown, Fauquier County, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34780967167 Benjamin Rector];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-49795338 Ludwell Rector];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-49793258 Thomas Rector];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-49795323 Charles Rector];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-49795345 Sally Chrisman (Rector)];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34664128286 Mary &quot;Molly&quot; Rector (Rector)];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-49795322 Nancy Bartlett (Rector)];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-49795337 Rebecca Kincheloe (Rector)];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-49795344 Daniel Rector]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 2, 1808 in Rectortown, Fauquier County, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Son of  
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Richter,   b. 1 Dec 1711, Trupbach or Siegen, Nassau-Siegen (now Germany),   d. 11 Mar 1773, Rectortown, Fauquier County, Virginia  (Age 61 years) 
2 CONT
2 CONT and 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Catharine Fishback,   b. Abt 1714, Germanna, Virginia,   d. 1775, Rectortown, Fauquier County, Virginia  (Age ~ 61 years) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Sarah "Sally"
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 Children 	
2 CONT *  	1. Benjamin Rector,   b. Abt 1770,   d. 1869, Rectortown, Fauquier County, Virginia  (Age ~ 99 years)
2 CONT *  	2. Ludwell Rector,   b. Abt 1772,   d. Between 1849 and 1850, Fauquier County, Virginia  (Age ~ 77 years)  
2 CONT *  	3. Thomas Rector,   b. 26 Jan 1774,   d. 3 Oct 1824, Fauquier County, Virginia  (Age 50 years)  
2 CONT *  	4. Charles Rector,   b. 24 Apr 1776, Virginia,   d. 26 Jun 1859, Jackson County, West Virginia  (Age 83 years)  
2 CONT *  	5. Sally Rector,   b. Abt 1778  
2 CONT *  	6. Mary "Molly" Rector,   b. Abt 1780 
2 CONT *  	7. Nancy Rector,   b. Between 1783 and 1785 
2 CONT *  	8. Rebecca Rector,   b. Between 1785 and 1787 
2 CONT *  	9. Daniel Rector,   b. Between 1789 and 1790 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://germannafamily.org/getperson.php?personID=I046006&tree=tree1 ----
