1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://germannafamily.org/getperson.php?personID=I077855&tree=tree1
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Daniel Rector, Senior b. 2/8/1641/2 Germantown, Fauquier County, Virginia d. 1 May 1814 Clark County, Ohio.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Johannes Rector and Ann Catharina Fishback.
2 CONT
2 CONT married 
2 CONT # Nancy "Ann" Oldham, married January 17, 1760.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT #  Winifred Rector b: 6 MAR 1756 in Prince William, Virginia
2 CONT #  John Rector b: ABT 1758
2 CONT #  Conway Rector b: ABT 1760 in of, Hampshire, Virginia
2 CONT # Charles M. Rector b: 26 MAR 1761 in Rectortown, Fauquier County, Virginia
2 CONT #  Nancy Rector b: 1767
2 CONT #  Abigail Rector b: ABT 1768
2 CONT #  Daniel Rector , Jr. b: ABT 1770
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Served in the Revolutionary War. (??)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1738 BIRTH: Larry King, Rector Records, (Hendersonville, Tennessee: 1986), 5, "3-3 DANIEL RECTOR, SR. s/o 2-1, B abt 1738 in VA. M 7 Jan 1760 Nancy Ann Oldham. C 4-8; 4-9; 4-10; 4-11; 4-12; 4-13; Abagail M John Battershell. Census
2 CONC  records for 1790 show Daniel Rector living in Allegheny CO., PA. He D 1 May 1814."
2 CONT
2 CONT Source(s): 
2 CONT * Germanna Record. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=52987224
2 CONT * http://www.bassett.net/gendata-o/p6277.htm
2 CONT * http://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Daniel_Rector_%284%29
2 CONT * http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=marcwheat&id=I03894
2 CONT * * Eleanor Rector Notes: "The Memorial Foundation of the Germanna Colonies in Virginia." (Manuscript). "Eleanor Rector states Daniel Rector, Sr. bortn 8 Feb 1742 Va. Married to Nancy 7 Jan 1760. They had 7 children. He died 1 May
2 CONC  1814 in Clark Co. Ohio. She cites History of German Twp. Clark Co. Ohio, p12. She also cites Clifford Rector, Rector Family."
2 CONT
