1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Stephen Harnesberger''' was born in 1716 in Augusta County, Virginia. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-67235809 Hans Heerensperger] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-67235810 Anna Barbara Harnesberger (unk)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-67235624 Agnes Hofmann] in 1738 in Virginia, United States. Together they had the following 4 children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34685302264 John Harnsberger]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34685302261 Barbara Harnsberger]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34685302262 Elizabeth Harnsberger];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-67235452 Margaret Harnsberger]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-113075014 Ursula Harnesberger (Scheitley)] circa 1750. Together they had the following 5 children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34685307335 Adam Harnesberger, Sr.]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34685299795 Henry Harnesberger]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34658978169 Stephen Harnsberger]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-98757991 Conrad Harnsberger]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-113073264 Robert Harnsberger]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He died between 1775 and 1776 in Augusta County, Virginia. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Member of the 1717 or Second Germanna Colony (child)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT
2 CONT [S0040896] John Harnsberger, 1717 Germanna Colonist, and Some of his Descendants,Part 2, Wanda Miller Cunningham, (Name: Beyond Germanna, Volume 7 No. 4, July 1995, p 395-396;).
2 CONT
