2 CONT '''Alse Hoffman (Fishback)''' was born circa 1727 in Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-49790367 Harman (“Harman”) Fischbach] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-69409611 Anna Cathrina Fishback (
2 CONC Utterback)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alse married John Hoffman
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following 8 known children:
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Joseph-Huffman/6000000186267618087?through=6000000002906988689;
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254168 Christena Fishback (Hoffman)];
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Rev-Daniel-Huffman/6000000175960948104?through=6000000002906988689;
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Rev-James-Huffman/6000000175960948219?through=6000000002906988689;
