1 NAME Carl Johan /Cronstedt/ Greve
2 GIVN Carl Johan
2 SURN Cronstedt
2 NSFX Greve
1 NAME //
2 GIVN
2 SURN
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 APR 1709
