2 CONT ===Titanic Passenger Summary===
2 CONT Name: Mrs Sigrid Lindström (née Posse)
2 CONT Titanic Survivor
2 CONT Born: Thursday 18th December 1856 in Ängelholm, Skåne, Sweden 
2 CONT Age: 55 years 3 months and 28 days (Female)
2 CONT Nationality: Swedish
2 CONT Marital Status: Married to Carl Johan Lindström
2 CONT Last Residence: at Östermalmsgatan 20Stockholm, Uppland, Sweden
2 CONT 1st Class Passengers
2 CONT Embarked: Cherbourg on Wednesday 10th April 1912
2 CONT Ticket No. 112377, £27 14s 5d 
2 CONT Rescued  
2 CONT Disembarked Carpathia: New York City on Thursday 18th April 1912
2 CONT Died: Sunday 3rd November 1946 in Stockholm, Uppland, Sweden aged 89 years
2 CONT Buried: Norra begravningsplatsen, Stockholm, Uppland, Sweden on Monday 11th November 1946
