1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jacob Hager,''' son of Johann Philip Hager, was born c.1760 in Augusta County, Virginia, and died c.1850 in Tazewell County, Virginia. He married Sarah Penner French. Sarah was also known as Sally. She was born 
2 CONC c.1766 in Maryland or Pennsylvania, and died after 1870 in Bland County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Once source said he was born in Germany and emigrated to Virginia, with his father, as a child. This is an error - it was his uncle of the same name that emigrated, c.1732, from Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is possible (although unlikely) that Jacob's wife lived to be over 100 years old. Sources have her born in c.1766 and dying in or after 1870. More documents need to be found  to confirm these dates.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JACOB HAGER and SARAH FRENCH are:
2 CONT * GEORGE3 HAGER, b. Aft. 1789.
2 CONT * JAMES 'BLACK JIM' HAGER, b. Abt. 1791, Fayette County, Pennsylvania; d. October 15, 1859, Boone County, (West) Virginia.
2 CONT * THURSZA HAGER, b. Bef. 1793; m. FIELDING BURTON, April 11, 1811, Tazewell County, Virginia; b. Bef. 1791.
2 CONT * CATHERINE HAGER, b. Abt. 1797, Tazewell County, Virginia; d. Aft. 1860, Boone County, (West) Virginia.
2 CONT * ABRAHAM HAGER, b. Abt. 1800, Tazewell County, Virginia.
2 CONT * ALEXANDER ALLEN 'ALEM' HAGER, b. Abt. 1800, Tazewell County, Virginia; d. Abt. 1870, Mercer County, West Virginia.
2 CONT * ESQUIRE 'JASPER' HAGER, b. Abt. 1807, Tazewell County, Virginia; d. Bet. 1860 - 1870.
2 CONT * MARY 'POLLY' HAGER, b. Abt. 1811, Tazewell County, Virginia; d. Pike County, Kentucky.
2 CONT
