1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Catherine Hager was born c.1788 in Tazewell County, Virginia. She was the daughter of Philip Hager and wife Sarah.
2 CONT
2 CONT One source claims she was born in Bucks County, Pennsylvania. This is unlikely. It is roughly 513 miles between Bucks Count and Tazewell County. There are no records indicating that her parents went to Pennsylvania in the late 178
2 CONC 0's, There were several other, unrelated, Hager families in America at this time. It is most likely that the research confused two girls from different families.
2 CONT
