2 CONT Per Alix V. :  "Served as a Lt. in the 1st VA State Regt.  Also served in the 1st Light Dragoons & was a prisoner until 1 May 1783.  After the Rev. War Thomas was awarded a bounty of 2,666 acres of land.  S/O John & Margaret O'Rea
2 CONC r Glascock.  Brother of George Glascock, husband of Hannah Rector.  Thomas married Agatha Rector after the death of Catherine."
2 CONT ==========
2 CONT Per Alix V. e-mail to the Germanna Colonies Mail List, dated 06-26-1999: "Served as a Lt. in the 1st VA State Regt.  Also served in the 1st Light Dragoons & was a prisoner until 1 May 1783.  After the Rev. War Thomas was awarded a
2 CONC  bounty of 2,666 acres of land."
