1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Ann 'Nancy' Conway (Rector)''' was born on December 12, 1770 in Fauquier County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-19614334 Frederick Rector] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-45089582 Elizabeth Rector (Connor)].
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34781110855 Runkle]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34781110858 Thomas Sheppard Runkle]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34781110859 Mary A Pelham (Runkle)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann married [https://www.geni.com/profile-82846253 Capt. Thomas Conway] on April 3, 1790 in Fauquier County, VA, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83131780 Henry Wharton Conway, Ark. Ter. Delegate to Congress]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83425791 James Sevier Conway, 1st Gov. of Arkansas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83427423 Frederick Rector Conway]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83427722 Dr. John R. Conway]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83427874 Eliza Shields (Conway)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83427963 Judge William Conway]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83428095 Sarah Garritson (Conway)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83428179 Thomas A. Conway]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83132809 Elias Nelson Conway, 5th Gov. of Arkansas]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 9, 1845 in Little Rock, Pulaski County, Arkansas, United States and was buried in Mt. Holly Cemetery. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Family 1	Runkle''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT *  	1. Thomas Sheppard Runkle 
2 CONT *  	2. Mary A. Runkle
2 CONT
2 CONT Family ID	F33238 	Group Sheet  |  Family Chart
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family 2	Captain Thomas Conway''',   d. Missouri; Married	11 Apr 1792, Greene County, Tennessee
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT *  	1. Dr. John Rector Conway 
2 CONT *  	2. William Conway 
2 CONT *  	3. Eliza Conway
2 CONT *  	4. Sarah Hundley Conway
2 CONT *  	5. Elias Nelson Conway 
2 CONT *  	6. Thomas Asbury Conway 
2 CONT *  	7. Henry W. Conway,   d. 1827, Arkansas 
2 CONT *  	8. James Sevier Conway
2 CONT *  	9. Frederick Rector Conway
2 CONT
2 CONT http://germannafamily.org/getperson.php?personID=I001192&tree=tree1
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Mother of 11 Children, including the 1st Governor of Arkansas and Elias (5th Governor of Arkansas). 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a leader at The First Methodist Church, Little Rock, Arkansas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She deserves much credit for having survived the times, she braved a wild frontier and helped tame it.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source ?
2 CONT ----
2 CONT She was the Wife of Thomas Conway and mother of Arkansas Governors James Sevier Conway (1st Governor) and Elias Nelson Conway (5th Governor) and also was the mother of Frederick Rector Conway and William Conway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT
2 CONT "....were members of the Methodist Episcopal Church and zealously served God and each of them died in full hope of a happy immortality"
2 CONT
2 CONT "Blessed are the pure in heart for they shall see God"
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/7546722/ann-conway
2 CONT ----
