2 CONT Zachariah, John and Adam were sons of John Michael and Anna Magdalena Thomas Smith. James Thomas was the son of Zachariah. None of the daughters or sons in law of John Michael and Anna Magdalena went to KY. as far as I can tell --
2 CONC  remaining in Culpeper/Madison Co., VA  Both Zachariah AKA Zacharias Smith and his brother, John sold their land in Culpeper Co in 1777 -- same day -- to Henry Field Jr. When Henry Fields Jr died in Culpeper Co. VA in 1787, he lef
2 CONC t 3400 acres of land in Kentucky  Land Survey and Grant Adam Smith, assignee of John Bowman, 400 acres by virtue of part of a preemption warrant # 560 Lincoln Co. joining John Bowman's settlement on Harrod's Run, in McBride's line
