1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Judith Hathaway'''
2 CONT * Born 26 Apr 1755 	Lancaster County, Virginia
2 CONT * Died 1 Mar 1846 	Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio
2 CONT * Re Buried 29 May 1867 Spring Grove Cemetery, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio; Section 47, Lot 74, removed from Family Grounds, Walnut Hills
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married Rev. James Kemper 26 December 1754.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15 children:
2 CONT #Frances Kemper,   b. 1 Sep 1773, Fauquier County, Virginia,   d. Apr 1851, Dayton, Ohio  (Age 77 years)
2 CONT #Elnathan Kemper,   b. 23 Sep 1775, Fauquier County, Virginia,   d. 17 Aug 1834, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio  (Age 58 years) 
2 CONT #Sarah Lawson Kemper,   b. 27 Feb 1777, Fauquier County, Virginia,   d. 22 Dec 1836, Saline County, Missouri   (Age 59 years)
2 CONT #Caleb Kemper,   b. 19 Nov 1778, Fauquier County, Virginia,   d. 16 Oct 1832, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio  (Age 53 years) 
2 CONT #Peter Hathaway Kemper,   b. 5 Oct 1780, Fauquier County, Virginia,   d. 23 Jul 1853, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio   (Age 72 years)  
2 CONT #Dr. Edward Young Kemper,   b. 11 Jan 1783, Fauquier County, Virginia,   d. 10 Jun 1863, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio  (Age 80 years)  
2 CONT #James Kemper, Jr.,   b. 19 Apr 1785, Garrard County, Kentucky,   d. 17 Jan 1856, Maysville, Kentucky  (Age 70 years) 
2 CONT #John Flavel Kemper,   b. 1 Mar 1787, Garrard County, Kentucky,   d. 1864, Powhatan County, Virginia  (Age 76 years) 
2 CONT #Judith Blair Kemper,   b. 10 Sep 1788, Garrard County, Kentucky,   d. 21 Oct 1848, Ashland, Kentucky  (Age 60 years)  
2 CONT #Samuel Dodridge Kemper,   b. 21 Oct 1790, Boyle County, Kentucky,   d. 26 May 1866, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio  (Age 75 years)  
2 CONT #David Rice Kemper,   b. 28 May 1793, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio,   d. 8 Sep 1849, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio  (Age 56 years)  
2 CONT #Sophia Elizabeth Kemper,   b. 27 May 1795, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio,   d. 31 Mar 1830, Flemingsburg, Kentucky  (Age 34 years)  
2 CONT #Agnes Susan Timberlake Kemper,   b. 23 Jul 1797, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio,   d. 18 Jul 1853, Lexington, Missouri  (Age 55 years)  
2 CONT #Frederick Augustus Kemper,   b. 22 Jan 1799, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio,   d. 24 Jul 1851, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio  (Age 52 years)  
2 CONT #Charles Adolphus Benjamin Kemper,   b. 4 Jun 1804, Walnut Hills, Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio,   d. 4 Sep 1871, Glendale, Ohio   (Age 67 years)
2 CONT
2 CONT http://germannafamily.org/getperson.php?personID=I049412&tree=tree1
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Judith Hathaway Kemper
2 CONT * BIRTH	26 Apr 1755 
2 CONT * White Stone, Lancaster County, Virginia, USA 
2 CONT * DEATH	1 Mar 1846 (aged 90) 
2 CONT * Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio, USA 
2 CONT * BURIAL	 
2 CONT * Spring Grove Cemetery 
2 CONT * Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio, 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/64385859/judith-kemper
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''Judith Hathaway Kemper came from a slave owning family according to her father's will.  Does anyone have access to records to find out how many slaves he owned?  She married an Abolitionist, the Rev. James Kemper.. He trained
2 CONC  with the Rev. David Rice in Kentucky.  Rice was an early Abolitionist.  Rice was kicked out of Virginia for his interactions with slaves.  Two of James and Judith's children were named for Rice and his wife.  Rice was on the cons
2 CONC titutional committee drafting the constitution for Kentucky.  He proposed  a plank  that slavery be gradually abolished.  It was voted down.  Kemper supported David Rice when he was too old to work.  James Kemper founded Lane Semi
2 CONC nary, hired Lyman Beecher, Harriet Beecher Stowe's father to be president.   Judith went from a family owning slaves to being a frontier woman who raised 15 children without Slaves. That is quite a journey. From: Jaime Howley ''' 
2 CONC '''https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Hathaway-1023
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=64385859
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.coffey.ws/FamilyTree/Docs/HATHAWAYJohn%28C%29.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT by VERNON DIXON (Contact) Birth:	Apr 26 1756 - White Stone, Lancaster County, Virginia, USA
2 CONT ----
