1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.geocities.ws/pvorenberg/pafn07.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT In about 1762, Daniel Mauck married first, Barbara Harnsberger, daughter of Stephen Harnsberger and his first wife Agnes. Stephen Harnsberger came to this county in 1717 with his parents John and Anna Harnsberger. (records of Spot
2 CONC sylvania County, Virginia)
2 CONT
2 CONT January 19, 1759 -- See will Book A., page 212 in Culpeper County records the will of John Harnsberger. In his will he mentions John Harnsberger, Barbara, Elizabeth, and Margaret as children of Stephen by his first wife, Agnes.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: MAUCK-BRUBAKER Families of The Page Valley of Virginia by Mary S. Brubaker, p. 5.
