1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for VIRGINIA (Soldier).  [https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A047795   DAR Ancestor # A047795]
2 CONT DAR proved wife 	CHRISTINE HOFFMAN
2 CONT DAR proved children:
2 CONT # JOHN 	[1] ANN CLORE   	
2 CONT # BENJAMIN 	[1] SARAH J RICE
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Harmon Fishback''' was born on November 26, 1741 in Orange County, Virginia. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-49790367 Harman (“Harman”) Fischbach] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-69409611 Anna Cathrina Fishback
2 CONC  (Utterback)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Harmon married [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254168 Christena Fishback (Hoffman)] on July 16, 1771. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34672676815 Leanna Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254173 Mary Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254175 Susanna Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34672676831 John Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254177 Agatha Weakley (Fishback)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254179 Rosannah Weakley (Fishback)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34672676825 James Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254187 Frances Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254188 Sarah Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254189 Elizabeth Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34672676820 Benjamin Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254191 Thomas B. Fishback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-46254192 Lucy Lacy (Fishback)].  
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 22, 1804 in Madison County, Virginia, United States and was buried in Oak Park, Virginia. 
2 CONT ----
