1 NAME Balthasar /Mentzer/
2 GIVN Balthasar
2 _MARNM Mentzer
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 FEB 1565
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bad Sooden Allendorf
3 STAE HE
3 CTRY Germany
